Fully rigged 3D model of Wedding Dove. With wing and feathers controllers. Perfect and essential element of your wedding!

**Features:**

* Game ready asset;
* Fully rigged;
* Subdivision ready;
* Include individual controllers for feathers, wings, eyes, beak, legs and tails;
* The structure of the 3D model makes it possible to create realistic animations of real dove behavior.

